{
  "comment": "Every root under infrastructure/terraform/bootstrap and how .github/workflows/bootstrap-drift-plan.yml treats it (honua-iac#320). scripts/bootstrap-drift-roots.py refuses an unlisted root. applied=true: planned nightly against its state with the inputs below ({account_id} and {state_bucket} are filled in at run time); any change is drift. applied=false: the job asserts that no state object exists under its key. A standing entry tolerates ONE exact provider artifact and must link the issue that removes it.",
